+# UI10 hand-back — 2026-10-06
+
+## Result
+
+Reduced the Dock tile's white margin by cropping only transparent pixels from its source image before rendering. The alpha scan covers every pixel; a small inset remains, and a rendered-pixel assertion confirms the lower-right I.A signature survived. The original burgundy-and-black artwork remains intact in the app and Dock.
+
+The menu-bar image now uses a neutral grayscale gradient, with a neutral decision dot and outline in both appearances. Four plain/badged light/graphite menu snapshots and light/graphite Dock snapshots were generated under ignored `app/Snapshots/` and visually inspected.
