+## Review challenge
+
+The first enlarged render clipped the I.A signature. It was replaced with an exact alpha-bound crop plus a safety inset, and the Dock test now checks the signature region. Independent review then found that the badge outline could inherit a blue tint and that the original alpha scan sampled only every fourth pixel. The badge now uses a neutral outline color; the crop scans every pixel; the grayscale test checks near-opaque pixels tightly enough to reject the old tinted outline. A follow-up independent review found no remaining actionable issues.
